WEBVTT

01:38.090 --> 01:41.050
[The Demon Hunter's Romance]

01:41.090 --> 01:43.950
[Episode 16]

01:45.200 --> 01:46.280
Thank you, ladies. Have a nice day.

01:46.280 --> 01:48.840
Nuts, delicious nuts!

01:48.870 --> 01:49.280
Sir.

01:49.580 --> 01:50.300
Feel free to browse.

01:50.300 --> 01:50.860
You can sample them.

01:50.860 --> 01:51.840
Is this expensive?

01:51.840 --> 01:53.170
It's not, just one tael.

02:04.070 --> 02:05.480
Xue Qiao, are you okay?

02:06.030 --> 02:06.640
I'm okay.

02:11.670 --> 02:14.700
[Demon Hunter Xue Qiao]

02:11.670 --> 02:14.700
[Demon Hunter Jiang Shangyun]

02:17.750 --> 02:19.170
I just prayed to the Bodhisattva

02:19.170 --> 02:20.960
to help me find a suitable house.

02:20.960 --> 02:23.470
I hope there will be good news in the next couple of days.

02:23.470 --> 02:24.280
How much longer can you stay

02:24.280 --> 02:25.310
in that troupe?

02:26.130 --> 02:27.660
Until the end of this month.

02:27.840 --> 02:28.710
Ji Li left,

02:29.030 --> 02:30.190
and the troupe's business hasn't been good.

02:30.190 --> 02:31.570
That unscrupulous Manager He

02:31.570 --> 02:32.560
gave up the lease of the courtyard

02:32.560 --> 02:34.750
and told us to find our own place to stay.

02:34.750 --> 02:36.030
This is just inhuman.

02:37.440 --> 02:38.470
If by the end of the month,

02:38.470 --> 02:39.870
you still haven't found a place to stay,

02:39.870 --> 02:41.329
just come and live with me.

02:41.470 --> 02:43.400
No need. I'm sure I can find a place.

02:43.400 --> 02:45.340
Besides, there are four of us living together.

02:45.340 --> 02:47.670
It would be inappropriate if I left alone.

02:49.140 --> 02:50.800
What's wrong? Do you know him?

02:54.120 --> 02:55.380
I'll wait for you here.

02:56.120 --> 02:56.630
Okay.

03:00.870 --> 03:01.470
Xuanye.

03:02.760 --> 03:03.730
It really is you.

03:03.910 --> 03:05.570
I recognized you from behind.

03:05.630 --> 03:06.760
Why are you here too?

03:08.000 --> 03:10.260
I just went to Fa'en Temple with a friend.

03:17.300 --> 03:18.230
A fish is biting.

03:31.980 --> 03:33.160
Why did you throw it back?

03:33.160 --> 03:34.280
That fish is too stupid.

03:34.280 --> 03:36.280
Eating it would be bad for the brain.

03:41.079 --> 03:43.079
Where have you been these past few days?

03:43.079 --> 03:44.810
I haven't seen you around much.

03:47.140 --> 03:49.800
I've been thinking about your father's matter,

03:50.750 --> 03:52.440
and I made a trip to

03:52.460 --> 03:54.010
Shaozhou Prefecture these past few days.

03:54.010 --> 03:55.220
That place is where Chi Wangchuan

03:55.220 --> 03:56.550
settled five years ago.

03:57.490 --> 03:58.750
Actually, Chi Wangchuan

03:58.750 --> 04:00.400
was entrusted by another demon

04:00.400 --> 04:01.660
to kidnap your father.

04:02.280 --> 04:04.410
So by following Chi Wangchuan's lead,

04:04.550 --> 04:06.550
we should be able to find some clues.

04:06.860 --> 04:08.300
Did you find anything?

04:10.080 --> 04:11.080
I have some leads.

04:21.570 --> 04:22.660
Why does this fish look

04:22.660 --> 04:24.060
just like the one before?

04:31.860 --> 04:33.570
Let's go back together.

04:34.040 --> 04:35.159
You're done fishing?

04:35.159 --> 04:35.630
Yes.

04:37.720 --> 04:38.680
Let me help you.

04:42.750 --> 04:43.310
Let's go.

04:50.870 --> 04:51.800
Young Master.

04:51.820 --> 04:52.310
We've met before

04:52.310 --> 04:53.640
at Yunmen Dance Troupe.

04:53.680 --> 04:54.610
Do you remember?

04:54.920 --> 04:55.390
I do.

04:56.360 --> 04:56.840
Banxia,

04:57.159 --> 04:58.890
who is this young master to you?

05:03.430 --> 05:04.770
He's my neighbor,

05:04.800 --> 05:07.330
Physician Jiu from Ganshan Clinic next door.

05:07.630 --> 05:09.120
Your neighborly relationship

05:09.120 --> 05:10.120
seems quite good.

05:12.070 --> 05:13.160
Hello, Physician Jiu.

05:13.160 --> 05:14.240
My name is Xu Zhizhi.

05:14.240 --> 05:15.530
I'm a dancer from Yunmen Dance Troupe

05:15.530 --> 05:16.730
and Banxia's friend.

05:17.310 --> 05:18.170
Hello, Miss Xu.

05:18.950 --> 05:19.680
Later, I'll-

05:19.680 --> 05:20.740
Alright, alright.

05:21.040 --> 05:22.340
You should talk less.

05:23.190 --> 05:23.980
Let's go.

05:43.090 --> 05:44.610
[To my husband Yingheng
From Tang Ruyun]

06:18.600 --> 06:19.160
Xuanye.

06:21.090 --> 06:21.890
What's wrong?

06:26.160 --> 06:26.720
Xuanye.

06:27.310 --> 06:29.440
Are you going to the Underground City?

06:30.920 --> 06:31.450
Yes, I am.

06:32.080 --> 06:33.040
But when your father was around,

06:33.040 --> 06:33.750
he told you

06:33.780 --> 06:36.780
not to go to the Underground City. Have you forgotten?

06:38.390 --> 06:39.920
I caught quite a few fish today.

06:39.920 --> 06:41.050
Clean this place up.

06:46.050 --> 06:49.340
[Court of Judicial Review, Shendu City]

06:48.830 --> 06:49.830
After you go back,

06:49.850 --> 06:51.540
give this to Lord Geng.

06:51.770 --> 06:52.210
Yes.

06:55.050 --> 06:57.840
[Song Zhilian, Minister of the Court of Judicial Review]

06:55.530 --> 06:56.130
Youhuang.

06:56.510 --> 06:58.570
How have you been doing in Guangping?

06:59.510 --> 07:00.120
My Lord.

07:00.830 --> 07:02.510
Guangping City is a place of outstanding people and beautiful scenery,

07:02.510 --> 07:03.720
and the climate is pleasant.

07:03.720 --> 07:06.280
I've had a comfortable time there.

07:07.600 --> 07:08.700
You're still young,

07:08.700 --> 07:10.230
with a bright future ahead.

07:10.240 --> 07:12.100
You shouldn't just seek comfort.

07:12.390 --> 07:14.240
I heard that working under Lord Geng,

07:14.240 --> 07:16.630
you've been diligent, composed, and capable,

07:16.630 --> 07:18.830
and you've solved quite a few major cases.

07:18.830 --> 07:20.830
He thinks very highly of you, right?

07:21.680 --> 07:23.430
It's all thanks to Lord Geng's guidance.

07:23.430 --> 07:25.030
I dare not take credit for it.

07:27.640 --> 07:29.870
You used to work at the Court of Judicial Review under me.

07:29.870 --> 07:30.950
I know very well

07:31.340 --> 07:32.820
how capable you are.

07:33.920 --> 07:35.320
If you hadn't left Shendu

07:35.480 --> 07:37.080
for that incident back then,

07:37.080 --> 07:40.740
how could Geng Zhen have gotten himself such a great subordinate?

07:48.210 --> 07:49.460
Since you seldom come back,

07:49.460 --> 07:50.670
stay for a few more days

07:50.670 --> 07:52.560
and get together with your former colleagues.

07:52.560 --> 07:53.760
Don't rush to go back.

07:55.159 --> 07:56.490
As you command, My Lord.

07:57.080 --> 07:59.640
[Establish Virtue]

08:01.310 --> 08:02.390
I wonder if Youhuang

08:02.390 --> 08:03.590
has really come back.

08:05.430 --> 08:06.040
Youhuang?

08:06.310 --> 08:06.910
Youhuang!

08:07.310 --> 08:08.030
They said you were back,

08:08.030 --> 08:08.800
but I didn't believe it.

08:08.800 --> 08:10.310
I can't believe you're really back.

08:10.310 --> 08:11.480
Ming, Yue.

08:11.480 --> 08:12.680
It's been a long time.

08:12.780 --> 08:14.510
How long can you stay this time?

08:14.680 --> 08:15.190
Right.

08:15.830 --> 08:17.000
I can't stay for long.

08:17.000 --> 08:18.310
I have too many miscellaneous matters to attend to.

08:18.310 --> 08:19.170
I can't delay for too long.

08:19.170 --> 08:20.190
Too many miscellaneous matters?

08:20.190 --> 08:21.720
No matter what miscellaneous matters you have,

08:21.720 --> 08:23.310
you're mine today.

08:23.630 --> 08:25.160
How about Hu's Mutton Soup?

08:25.270 --> 08:25.750
Look.

08:26.240 --> 08:27.680
Yue indeed knows me best.

08:28.720 --> 08:29.570
In Guangping,

08:29.600 --> 08:31.600
what I've been thinking about day and night

08:31.600 --> 08:32.730
is this mutton soup.

08:33.080 --> 08:34.600
Then why are we still standing here? Let's go.

08:34.600 --> 08:35.510
-Let's go.
-Let's go.

08:35.510 --> 08:36.909
In broad daylight,

08:37.720 --> 08:39.450
with a pile of work left undone,

08:47.430 --> 08:49.160
you guys are going back for a drink?

08:49.080 --> 08:52.350
[Court of Judicial Review Commissioner, Sima Lingying]

08:50.720 --> 08:51.850
Commissioner Sima.

08:59.200 --> 09:02.000
So it's because you're back, Chief Constable Chu.

09:03.360 --> 09:04.220
Commissioner.

09:05.510 --> 09:07.550
When did you come back, Chief Constable Chu?

09:07.550 --> 09:08.960
We used to be colleagues after all.

09:08.960 --> 09:12.440
Why didn't you come to see me now that you're back in the capital?

09:12.440 --> 09:13.320
I just arrived.

09:14.030 --> 09:14.670
I haven't had the chance

09:14.670 --> 09:16.270
to visit you, Commissioner.

09:18.320 --> 09:20.320
I heard you're moving to a new house.

09:21.380 --> 09:22.260
Commissioner.

09:22.410 --> 09:23.240
Yes, that's right.

09:23.240 --> 09:24.240
I'm about to move.

09:24.320 --> 09:24.790
My wife

09:24.790 --> 09:26.080
is pregnant with our fourth child.

09:26.080 --> 09:27.510
She's about to give birth soon.

09:27.510 --> 09:28.670
The small courtyard we've been living in

09:28.670 --> 09:29.750
is really too small for us now.

09:29.750 --> 09:30.410
So I thought

09:30.440 --> 09:31.440
I'd find a larger mansion

09:31.440 --> 09:32.590
near the government office

09:32.590 --> 09:34.150
and let my whole family move in.

09:34.150 --> 09:35.150
That's good news.

09:35.200 --> 09:36.600
It's worth celebrating.

09:36.670 --> 09:38.240
Everyone has been busy with official duties lately.

09:38.240 --> 09:39.910
We haven't gotten together for a long time.

09:39.910 --> 09:41.360
How about we take this opportunity

09:41.360 --> 09:43.440
to make a reservation at Deyue Restaurant

09:43.440 --> 09:45.080
and invite Xunjiang and the others

09:45.080 --> 09:47.270
to celebrate your housewarming together?

09:47.270 --> 09:47.840
Well...

09:52.000 --> 09:52.550
What?

09:54.120 --> 09:55.870
Do you have something else to do?

09:55.870 --> 09:56.480
No, no.

09:56.670 --> 09:57.550
Of course not.

09:58.060 --> 09:59.120
It's settled then.

09:59.270 --> 10:00.790
I'll go make the reservation right away.

10:00.790 --> 10:01.510
When the time comes,

10:01.510 --> 10:03.270
we'll respectfully await your arrival, Commissioner.

10:03.270 --> 10:03.800
Alright.

10:05.320 --> 10:08.000
Chief Constable Chu, if you don't have any other plans,

10:08.000 --> 10:09.600
why don't you join us as well?

10:10.550 --> 10:10.940
I...

10:14.030 --> 10:15.360
You're going to suffer.

10:19.480 --> 10:20.790
Why did you book a private room?

10:20.790 --> 10:22.050
It's small and stuffy.

10:22.480 --> 10:24.130
Isn't this great? We can even watch the dance performance.

10:24.130 --> 10:25.240
Commissioner is coming today.

10:25.240 --> 10:26.840
We have to show some respect.

10:26.920 --> 10:27.980
This is quite rare.

10:28.080 --> 10:28.840
Not really.

10:29.000 --> 10:30.730
It's because Youhuang is back.

10:33.840 --> 10:35.440
Has Deyue Restaurant been renovated?

10:35.440 --> 10:35.870
Why does it look

10:35.870 --> 10:37.200
different from before?

10:37.220 --> 10:38.750
You've been gone for years.

10:38.790 --> 10:40.250
Many things have changed.

10:40.670 --> 10:41.270
Youhuang.

10:41.670 --> 10:42.720
But some things

10:42.870 --> 10:44.200
haven't changed at all.

10:49.320 --> 10:50.380
Come on, Youhuang.

10:55.550 --> 10:57.840
Why hasn't Commissioner Sima arrived yet?

10:57.840 --> 10:59.640
She should be here soon, I guess.

11:01.270 --> 11:02.240
Come on.

11:03.000 --> 11:03.730
If you ask me,

11:03.880 --> 11:04.600
now that you're back this time,

11:04.600 --> 11:05.600
you shouldn't leave again.

11:05.600 --> 11:08.320
Guangping certainly can't compare with Shendu.

11:08.320 --> 11:09.440
Commissioner Sima's elder brother,

11:09.440 --> 11:10.150
needless to say,

11:10.150 --> 11:11.750
is now the Junior Tutor to the Crown Prince.

11:11.750 --> 11:12.880
He's highly valued.

11:12.910 --> 11:14.270
Not to mention her father.

11:14.270 --> 11:16.870
He's the current Grand Secretary, a first-rank minister.

11:16.870 --> 11:17.710
Besides, her maternal grandfather

11:17.710 --> 11:19.000
holds the title of Marquis.

11:19.000 --> 11:21.060
Her mother is the Empress Dowager's niece.

11:21.060 --> 11:22.610
Bro, if you ask me,

11:22.790 --> 11:23.750
no matter which one of them

11:23.750 --> 11:25.120
puts in a good word for you,

11:25.120 --> 11:26.720
you'd soar to great heights

11:26.750 --> 11:28.750
and achieve success effortlessly.

11:31.540 --> 11:31.970
Hey.

11:32.550 --> 11:33.300
Did you hear

11:33.330 --> 11:34.260
what I just said?

11:36.030 --> 11:37.480
No matter what you say, it's in vain.

11:37.480 --> 11:38.910
If he were willing to listen to you,

11:38.910 --> 11:40.670
he wouldn't have gone to Guangping in the first place.

11:40.670 --> 11:41.510
He would have already been

11:41.510 --> 11:42.870
the Sima family's son-in-law.

11:42.870 --> 11:44.000
He's just stubborn.

11:44.440 --> 11:45.670
Commissioner Sima has also been

11:45.670 --> 11:47.200
highly valued these years.

11:47.200 --> 11:48.440
She's got a bright future ahead.

11:48.440 --> 11:49.600
Yet he acts as if marrying her

11:49.600 --> 11:51.240
would be some huge loss for him.

11:51.240 --> 11:52.240
Right? You see...

11:55.510 --> 11:57.080
Those who wanted to marry her back then

11:57.080 --> 11:57.790
have probably changed graves

11:57.790 --> 11:58.990
several times by now.

11:59.440 --> 12:02.840
If you're so enthusiastic about it, why don't you marry her yourself?

12:02.840 --> 12:04.150
You think I don't want to?

12:04.150 --> 12:04.950
The problem is

12:05.170 --> 12:06.630
she's way out of my league.

12:08.540 --> 12:10.060
You talk too much, buddy.

12:10.800 --> 12:11.630
What did I say?

12:15.870 --> 12:18.000
It would be ridiculous if you were worthy of her.

12:18.000 --> 12:20.730
What are you chatting about? It's so lively here.

12:22.080 --> 12:23.940
-Commissioner.
-Commissioner.

12:29.270 --> 12:30.720
We're not at the government office now.

12:30.720 --> 12:31.960
There's no need to be so formal.

12:31.960 --> 12:32.620
Please sit.

12:35.790 --> 12:37.250
You didn't order any wine?

12:38.630 --> 12:39.240
Boss.

12:40.260 --> 12:42.340
Bring my "Intoxicating Thousand Mountains" here.

12:42.340 --> 12:42.970
Got it.

12:44.030 --> 12:44.690
Please sit.

13:00.600 --> 13:02.680
I know my presence might dampen your mood.

13:02.680 --> 13:05.540
I'll just have three glasses of wine and then leave.

13:07.200 --> 13:08.320
Commissioner, please don't say that.

13:08.320 --> 13:09.320
That's nonsense.

13:09.840 --> 13:10.420
Exactly.

13:10.790 --> 13:12.120
It's rare for you to grace us with your presence, Commissioner.

13:12.120 --> 13:13.270
How could you leave so soon?

13:13.270 --> 13:14.320
Yes. Right.

13:23.720 --> 13:24.250
Alright.

13:26.700 --> 13:27.630
This first toast

13:29.050 --> 13:30.050
is to His Majesty.

13:32.670 --> 13:34.000
If it weren't for His Majesty,

13:34.000 --> 13:36.000
we wouldn't be living in this glorious era of prosperity.

13:36.000 --> 13:37.450
Nor would we have

13:37.630 --> 13:39.160
such bright futures ahead.

13:39.410 --> 13:40.500
To His Majesty!

13:56.630 --> 13:57.630
This second toast

13:58.720 --> 14:00.450
is to you, Chief Constable Yue.

14:00.630 --> 14:02.200
Since I, Lingying, am a woman,

14:02.200 --> 14:03.930
I've often received your care.

14:04.320 --> 14:06.370
Now that you're moving to a new place,

14:06.370 --> 14:07.630
I'm also happy for you.

14:08.660 --> 14:09.910
I haven't moved yet. Not yet.

14:09.910 --> 14:11.630
But with your kind words, Commissioner,

14:11.630 --> 14:12.960
I'll surely move as soon as possible.

14:12.960 --> 14:14.320
When the time comes,

14:14.480 --> 14:16.030
I'll have to trouble you all, guys.

14:16.030 --> 14:16.550
Cheers.

14:17.200 --> 14:17.660
Cheers!

14:18.010 --> 14:19.070
-Cheers.
-Cheers.

14:33.150 --> 14:34.200
This third toast

14:38.030 --> 14:39.760
is to you, Chief Constable Chu.

14:45.870 --> 14:47.000
I heard that in Guangping,

14:47.000 --> 14:48.030
you've been thriving

14:48.030 --> 14:49.780
and are highly valued by your superior.

14:49.780 --> 14:51.150
That Lord Geng, Geng Zhen,

14:51.150 --> 14:53.150
is the Noble Consort's younger brother.

14:53.150 --> 14:55.030
Young and talented,

14:55.480 --> 14:58.120
he's bound to become a marquis or minister sooner or later.

14:58.120 --> 15:00.120
When you left me back then, Youhuang,

15:00.120 --> 15:01.920
I was indeed upset for a few days.

15:02.010 --> 15:04.200
I thought it was because I wasn't worthy of you.

15:04.200 --> 15:05.130
Little did I know

15:05.810 --> 15:08.540
you were leaving to serve a worthy lord from afar.

15:10.270 --> 15:11.470
You've got a good eye.

15:13.150 --> 15:14.480
Wish you

15:14.870 --> 15:16.230
a bright future, Chief Constable Chu.

15:16.230 --> 15:18.080
May you achieve great success soon.

15:18.080 --> 15:18.810
Thanks a lot.

15:27.480 --> 15:28.590
I've had my three glasses of wine.

15:28.590 --> 15:29.580
I'll take my leave now.

15:29.580 --> 15:30.640
See you, everyone.

15:32.960 --> 15:33.750
Oh, right.

15:35.720 --> 15:36.840
You are all Chief Constable Chu's

15:36.840 --> 15:38.500
good friends, like brothers.

15:38.840 --> 15:40.600
I'm sure you're of one mind with him

15:40.600 --> 15:42.060
and of similar character.

15:42.400 --> 15:44.440
I hope that when he achieves success in the future,

15:44.440 --> 15:45.970
he'll remember these good times

15:45.970 --> 15:48.100
of drinking and chatting with you all.

15:51.620 --> 15:52.680
Go. She's leaving.

15:53.350 --> 15:54.680
Hold on, Commissioner.

15:55.630 --> 15:56.490
Commissioner.

15:56.840 --> 15:57.550
It's late at night.

15:57.550 --> 15:58.970
It's not safe for you to walk alone.

15:58.970 --> 16:00.670
I'll have Youhuang escort you.

16:00.670 --> 16:01.840
Why are you pulling me?

16:01.840 --> 16:02.960
Didn't you see Commissioner

16:02.960 --> 16:03.910
is dressed in a woman's outfit today?

16:03.910 --> 16:04.510
Looking so pretty,

16:04.510 --> 16:05.440
what if she encounters some bad guys?

16:05.440 --> 16:06.030
Right, guys?

16:06.030 --> 16:06.500
Exactly.

16:06.500 --> 16:07.430
P-Pull him over.

16:07.510 --> 16:08.000
Pull him over.

16:08.000 --> 16:08.480
Right.

16:08.480 --> 16:09.670
Go, go quickly.

16:09.670 --> 16:10.270
Hurry up, you.

16:10.270 --> 16:11.240
Get going, you.

16:14.120 --> 16:14.720
Let's go.

16:15.440 --> 16:16.360
Are you angry?

16:19.360 --> 16:20.290
I wouldn't dare.

16:25.030 --> 16:26.090
You wouldn't dare?

16:28.080 --> 16:29.280
Chief Constable Chu.

16:30.080 --> 16:31.840
Although you were a scoundrel before,

16:31.840 --> 16:32.550
at least you were

16:32.550 --> 16:34.480
someone who dared to take responsibility for your actions.

16:34.480 --> 16:35.920
Why is it that after only six years,

16:35.920 --> 16:36.670
you've become so

16:36.670 --> 16:39.000
hypocritical, slick, and worldly-wise?

16:40.360 --> 16:41.390
I don't know what I've done

16:41.390 --> 16:42.600
to offend you, Commissioner Sima.

16:42.600 --> 16:43.270
You don't know?

16:43.270 --> 16:43.840
I don't.

16:50.390 --> 16:51.240
Six years ago,

16:51.360 --> 16:53.200
you publicly broke off our engagement and left me.

16:53.200 --> 16:54.130
You left Shendu,

16:54.720 --> 16:55.390
leaving me here alone

16:55.390 --> 16:57.510
to become the laughingstock of the entire city.

16:57.510 --> 16:59.370
What kind of engagement was that?

16:59.660 --> 17:01.940
At that time, my elder brother was kidnapped by bandits.

17:01.940 --> 17:02.820
I vowed that

17:03.200 --> 17:05.000
I would marry whoever saved him.

17:05.400 --> 17:06.270
You saved him,

17:06.589 --> 17:07.960
so naturally, you were my husband-to-be.

17:07.960 --> 17:10.030
But I didn't know about that at the time.

17:10.030 --> 17:11.720
My family, the Simas, publicly offered a reward.

17:11.720 --> 17:13.319
The whole city knew about it.

17:13.400 --> 17:14.270
How could you not know?

17:14.270 --> 17:15.470
I simply didn't know.

17:16.220 --> 17:17.150
I'm a constable.

17:17.270 --> 17:19.270
It's a constable's duty to catch bandits.

17:19.270 --> 17:22.000
Why would I need you to offer yourself to marry me?

17:25.339 --> 17:26.540
Why do you despise me?

17:27.000 --> 17:28.130
I don't despise you.

17:29.700 --> 17:32.030
Then why did you break off our engagement?

17:32.920 --> 17:34.580
I didn't know you at that time.

17:34.920 --> 17:36.650
I kindly rescued your brother,

17:37.200 --> 17:37.720
yet your grandfather

17:37.720 --> 17:38.720
brought your cousins

17:38.720 --> 17:39.550
to my house to force the marriage.

17:39.550 --> 17:40.410
I didn't agree,

17:40.590 --> 17:41.650
and then your uncle

17:41.880 --> 17:43.240
went to the Court of Judicial Review and asked my superior

17:43.240 --> 17:44.100
to pressure me,

17:44.310 --> 17:45.880
making my entire family have to

17:45.880 --> 17:47.590
leave Shendu in the middle of the night.

17:47.590 --> 17:49.440
I haven't even settled this score with you yet,

17:49.440 --> 17:50.550
and you're the one feeling wronged?

17:50.550 --> 17:51.790
It was just a marriage proposal.

17:51.790 --> 17:53.270
Did you really have to move in the middle of the night?

17:53.270 --> 17:53.880
Besides,

17:54.270 --> 17:55.310
am I some kind of monster?

17:55.310 --> 17:57.110
Am I really that unworthy of you?

17:57.350 --> 17:59.210
I'm the one who's unworthy of you.

18:00.000 --> 18:00.550
The marriage between a man and woman

18:00.550 --> 18:01.750
is a major life event.

18:02.160 --> 18:03.440
First, there should be mutual affection,

18:03.440 --> 18:05.310
and second, the two families should be of equal status.

18:05.310 --> 18:08.030
Commissioner Sima, you're from a wealthy and prestigious family,

18:08.030 --> 18:09.750
while I come from a humble background.

18:09.750 --> 18:11.010
Besides, before that,

18:11.350 --> 18:12.550
we had never even met.

18:13.240 --> 18:14.510
What kind of delusion

18:14.510 --> 18:15.310
made you think

18:15.920 --> 18:17.320
that we were a good match?

18:18.350 --> 18:18.950
Pedantic.

18:23.750 --> 18:25.590
My father also came from a humble background,

18:25.590 --> 18:26.680
but he married my mother.

18:26.680 --> 18:27.880
They've been living in harmony,

18:27.880 --> 18:29.920
and now he's a first-rank official.

18:30.480 --> 18:31.350
How come when it comes to you,

18:31.350 --> 18:32.810
there are so many excuses?

18:33.790 --> 18:35.270
Your father is a top scholar.

18:35.270 --> 18:36.600
How can I compare to him?

18:37.550 --> 18:39.150
I'm not an ambitious person.

18:39.330 --> 18:40.680
I can't spend my whole life

18:40.680 --> 18:41.750
climbing the ranks of officialdom

18:41.750 --> 18:43.720
and seeking wealth and status just to be a good match for you.

18:43.720 --> 18:45.400
I just want to be a good constable,

18:45.400 --> 18:47.480
catching criminals and protecting the people.

18:47.480 --> 18:48.640
Being a constable is good.

18:48.640 --> 18:50.440
Aren't I a constable myself too?

18:50.510 --> 18:52.590
No one's forcing you to become a high-ranking official.

18:52.590 --> 18:53.240
If I were after

18:53.240 --> 18:54.640
wealth and status,

18:54.960 --> 18:55.920
I'd go straight to the list of eligible bachelors

18:55.920 --> 18:56.960
and pick a husband from there.

18:56.960 --> 18:57.960
Why would I have chosen you?

18:57.960 --> 18:59.100
Sima Lingying.

19:02.230 --> 19:04.020
Your family background is illustrious,

19:04.020 --> 19:05.480
while I'm just a commoner.

19:05.850 --> 19:06.990
We're not even on the same level.

19:06.990 --> 19:09.720
How could we spend the rest of our lives together?

19:10.200 --> 19:11.030
Even though I left

19:11.030 --> 19:11.920
in a rush and

19:11.960 --> 19:13.550
wasn't considerate about your feelings,

19:13.550 --> 19:15.070
it's been six years.

19:15.070 --> 19:16.670
Can we stop dwelling on this?

19:16.790 --> 19:18.390
Let's reconcile and move on.

19:18.590 --> 19:19.000
You-

19:19.830 --> 19:20.440
Stop!

19:34.920 --> 19:36.030
Are you alright?

19:40.510 --> 19:40.960
Don't-

19:49.750 --> 19:50.610
What happened?

19:50.720 --> 19:51.310
Is that person okay?

19:51.310 --> 19:52.240
What's going on?

19:58.110 --> 19:58.830
Demon!

20:00.090 --> 20:00.810
Demon!

20:02.190 --> 20:02.920
Demon!

20:14.720 --> 20:15.440
Xuanye.

20:16.290 --> 20:17.320
I know why you want to go to

20:17.320 --> 20:18.580
the Underground City.

20:19.270 --> 20:21.090
There are demons in the Underground City.

20:21.090 --> 20:22.050
You learned about

20:22.050 --> 20:22.950
Chi Wangchuan's connection

20:22.950 --> 20:24.880
to the Underground City when you were in Shaozhou Prefecture.

20:24.880 --> 20:25.920
So you guess

20:25.920 --> 20:27.200
the demon that kidnapped Banxia's father

20:27.200 --> 20:27.970
lives there.

20:28.550 --> 20:30.350
That's why you want to go find it.

20:31.000 --> 20:33.000
But your father wouldn't let you go.

20:34.070 --> 20:35.880
I don't have any evidence right now.

20:35.880 --> 20:36.880
It's just a guess.

20:37.480 --> 20:39.170
The demon that can command Chi Wangchuan

20:39.170 --> 20:39.760
must have

20:39.790 --> 20:41.390
exceptional demonic power.

20:42.070 --> 20:42.960
If such a demon

20:43.200 --> 20:44.720
wanted to capture someone,

20:44.720 --> 20:46.240
why didn't it do it itself?

20:46.960 --> 20:48.250
I know there are

20:48.310 --> 20:48.880
several demons

20:48.880 --> 20:50.620
that have cultivated for over 100 years

20:50.620 --> 20:53.070
and don't like to go out much living in the Underground City.

20:53.070 --> 20:54.530
It's the flood season now.

20:54.690 --> 20:55.720
All the paths in and out of the Underground City

20:55.720 --> 20:56.510
are flooded.

20:56.750 --> 20:57.610
We can't get in.

20:58.070 --> 20:59.330
We have to wait longer.

21:00.270 --> 21:00.830
No way.

21:04.420 --> 21:06.950
Even if the water recedes, you still can't go.

21:07.070 --> 21:08.000
Your father said

21:08.200 --> 21:09.530
if you dared to go there,

21:09.750 --> 21:11.030
he'd break your legs.

22:09.830 --> 22:10.440
My Lady.

22:11.830 --> 22:12.310
My Lady?

22:14.190 --> 22:14.510
My Lady,

22:14.510 --> 22:15.880
why didn't you respond?

22:18.920 --> 22:19.750
What's this?

22:21.480 --> 22:22.080
Come here.

22:26.090 --> 22:27.290
Stop looking around.

22:30.560 --> 22:31.510
What is this?

22:32.880 --> 22:34.210
You treasure it so much?

22:35.890 --> 22:37.750
This is a gift from Physician Jiu.

22:41.160 --> 22:43.070
It's just a paper crane, isn't it?

22:43.960 --> 22:45.960
Why did Physician Jiu give you this?

22:48.480 --> 22:49.750
How would I know?

22:52.030 --> 22:52.590
But...

22:53.920 --> 22:55.070
I made a wild guess.

22:57.750 --> 22:59.720
So... What is your guess?

23:05.680 --> 23:06.940
Didn't those ancients

23:06.960 --> 23:08.110
all like

23:08.110 --> 23:10.110
to express emotions through birds?

23:10.240 --> 23:11.100
Think about it,

23:11.270 --> 23:13.480
"Cooing And Wooing", "The Swallow", and "Mandarin Ducks"

23:13.480 --> 23:15.030
from the Book of Songs

23:15.960 --> 23:17.550
are all poems about love.

23:18.270 --> 23:21.680
"Merrily the ospreys cry,
on the islet in the stream."

23:22.590 --> 23:26.120
"Gentle and graceful is the girl, a fit wife for the gentleman."

23:27.590 --> 23:28.390
There's more.

23:28.550 --> 23:29.280
There's also

23:29.680 --> 23:30.920
"A pair of swallows fly..."

23:30.920 --> 23:31.510
My Lady.

23:32.150 --> 23:33.150
I understand now.

23:34.720 --> 23:36.050
What do you understand?

23:36.550 --> 23:37.160
I understand

23:37.160 --> 23:38.890
what you want me to understand.

23:41.400 --> 23:43.200
What do I want you to understand?

23:43.590 --> 23:45.240
Don't you want me to say

23:45.690 --> 23:47.790
that Physician Jiu gave you this paper crane

23:47.790 --> 23:49.920
to express his longing for you?

23:51.200 --> 23:53.070
I... I didn't say that.

23:54.160 --> 23:56.240
He might not think that way either.

23:57.080 --> 23:58.270
It seems you really wish

23:58.270 --> 23:59.510
that's what he meant.

24:00.110 --> 24:00.680
My Lady,

24:01.680 --> 24:02.610
you're done for.

24:05.310 --> 24:06.590
Since you came back from

24:06.590 --> 24:08.070
Reunion Inn this time,

24:08.070 --> 24:08.960
I've noticed

24:09.790 --> 24:10.880
that your heart

24:11.090 --> 24:12.550
is firmly tied to

24:12.550 --> 24:13.410
Physician Jiu.

24:14.000 --> 24:15.510
If Master

24:15.530 --> 24:16.860
weren't still missing,

24:16.910 --> 24:18.680
you would have already torn down that wall

24:18.680 --> 24:21.080
and joined with him next door as one family.

24:21.380 --> 24:23.440
What nonsense are you talking about?

24:23.640 --> 24:25.170
I don't have such thoughts.

24:25.920 --> 24:28.180
You've made it so obvious.

24:29.000 --> 24:30.800
Even a blind person could see it.

24:33.400 --> 24:34.240
My Lady.

24:35.640 --> 24:37.300
There are words on this paper.

24:37.790 --> 24:39.990
Physician Jiu has written you a letter.

24:40.070 --> 24:41.130
Careful, careful.

24:44.830 --> 24:45.790
Tang Ruyun?

24:49.070 --> 24:49.880
My mother?

24:54.160 --> 24:55.620
Tang Ruyun is your mother?

24:56.750 --> 24:57.700
Are you sure

24:58.160 --> 25:00.360
this letter was written by your mother?

25:00.440 --> 25:01.310
That's right.

25:02.000 --> 25:04.130
I recognize my mother's handwriting.

25:04.240 --> 25:05.590
But my mother

25:05.590 --> 25:06.990
passed away 12 years ago.

25:07.590 --> 25:08.980
That year, I was kidnapped,

25:08.980 --> 25:11.240
and after I returned, I could see demons.

25:11.450 --> 25:12.350
My parents thought

25:12.350 --> 25:13.600
I had contracted some illness,

25:13.600 --> 25:16.110
so they took me by boat to the capital to seek medical treatment.

25:16.110 --> 25:17.510
We encountered a storm on the way,

25:17.510 --> 25:19.200
and my mother accidentally fell into the water.

25:19.200 --> 25:20.860
After that, she went missing.

25:21.130 --> 25:22.750
We all thought she had died.

25:24.490 --> 25:25.340
But look.

25:25.470 --> 25:27.470
It's dated the Year of the Water Rat.

25:27.830 --> 25:29.430
Wasn't that three years ago?

25:30.160 --> 25:31.890
Could my mother still be alive?

25:33.320 --> 25:33.830
Could it be

25:33.830 --> 25:36.240
it was written in the last Year of the Water Rat?

25:36.240 --> 25:37.350
The last Year of the Water Rat

25:37.350 --> 25:38.440
was 63 years ago.

25:38.830 --> 25:40.690
Her mother wasn't even born then.

25:41.830 --> 25:43.000
It must be so.

25:44.160 --> 25:45.820
My mother must still be alive.

25:46.350 --> 25:47.000
No wonder

25:48.010 --> 25:49.310
three years ago, my father suddenly

25:49.310 --> 25:51.170
sold several of our family shops,

25:51.750 --> 25:53.200
and he was away from home

25:53.200 --> 25:54.330
for most of the year.

25:55.280 --> 25:56.030
I always thought

25:56.030 --> 25:57.750
he was traveling for pleasure.

25:57.750 --> 26:00.550
I never thought he was out searching for my mother.

26:02.500 --> 26:03.760
But I don't understand

26:04.180 --> 26:05.110
why this letter

26:05.110 --> 26:06.910
was in the Cat Demon's money box.

26:09.780 --> 26:11.440
The Cat Demon exchanged lives with your father.

26:11.440 --> 26:13.040
It took your father's money,

26:13.460 --> 26:14.720
and then it gave all the money it collected

26:14.720 --> 26:15.400
to me.

26:17.070 --> 26:18.070
Perhaps it obtained

26:18.070 --> 26:19.110
this letter from your father

26:19.110 --> 26:20.440
at that time.

26:21.030 --> 26:22.560
It mistook it for a banknote

26:22.720 --> 26:24.180
and put it in the money box.

26:25.350 --> 26:26.750
My mother is still alive.

26:29.090 --> 26:30.400
Could my father's disappearance

26:30.400 --> 26:31.860
be related to this as well?

26:35.000 --> 26:37.170
It says Enlightenment Bookstore here,

26:37.170 --> 26:38.610
where my mother wrote this letter.

26:38.610 --> 26:39.610
So if we can find

26:39.640 --> 26:40.820
this Enlightenment Bookstore,

26:40.820 --> 26:43.150
we can find out their whereabouts, right?

26:44.750 --> 26:47.280
I don't know about Enlightenment Bookstore,

26:47.360 --> 26:48.680
but I recognize this

26:49.270 --> 26:50.470
Dongming grass mark.

26:58.730 --> 26:59.660
Dongming grass?

27:00.270 --> 27:01.730
My Lord, you recognize it?

27:03.000 --> 27:05.160
This is the symbol of Guangping Underground City.

27:05.160 --> 27:06.480
You've lived in Guangping for a long time.

27:06.480 --> 27:07.480
Don't you know about it?

27:07.480 --> 27:08.680
I've only heard of it,

27:09.200 --> 27:10.660
but I've never been there.

27:18.550 --> 27:21.210
This is the pass token for the Underground City.

27:23.750 --> 27:24.610
Dongming grass

27:24.880 --> 27:26.680
grows in Guangping Underground City.

27:26.680 --> 27:27.480
It's said that

27:28.070 --> 27:29.850
there are demons living in the Underground City.

27:29.850 --> 27:31.720
Therefore, the merchants there use grass

27:31.720 --> 27:32.520
as lamp wicks,

27:32.720 --> 27:33.730
placing them on the ceiling

27:33.730 --> 27:35.070
to reveal the demons

27:35.240 --> 27:36.370
and trade with them.

27:36.790 --> 27:37.550
Over time,

27:37.750 --> 27:39.880
Dongming grass became

27:40.070 --> 27:42.070
the symbol of the Underground City.

27:42.640 --> 27:45.320
My Lord, have you ever been to the Underground City?

27:45.320 --> 27:45.870
I have.

27:46.390 --> 27:47.190
Two years ago,

27:47.780 --> 27:49.260
when Lord Xin'an went missing,

27:49.260 --> 27:50.600
I was ordered by His Majesty

27:50.600 --> 27:52.530
to go there and search for him once.

27:53.340 --> 27:54.650
If that's the case,

27:54.960 --> 27:56.070
the paper demon

27:56.590 --> 27:58.390
came from the Underground City?

28:02.380 --> 28:03.720
My Lord, you don't seem surprised

28:03.720 --> 28:05.520
that demons exist in this world.

28:09.640 --> 28:10.680
The Court of Judicial Review of Shendu

28:10.680 --> 28:12.310
oversees all major criminal cases in the realm.

28:12.310 --> 28:13.750
You don't really think

28:13.770 --> 28:15.960
Guangping is the only place that has had demon troubles, do you?

28:15.960 --> 28:17.000
In this vast world,

28:17.000 --> 28:19.510
the existence of demons is not surprising.

28:24.680 --> 28:26.140
Where are you going later?

28:26.270 --> 28:28.000
Packing my bags and getting ready to leave.

28:28.000 --> 28:28.590
No rush.

28:28.590 --> 28:29.920
Come with me to my house.

28:30.350 --> 28:31.010
Your house?

28:31.750 --> 28:33.480
Yes, my mother wants to see you.

28:33.960 --> 28:35.000
Why does your mother want to see me?

28:35.000 --> 28:35.880
How would I know?

28:35.880 --> 28:36.680
Go and ask her in person,

28:36.680 --> 28:37.830
then you'll find out.

28:37.830 --> 28:38.440
I'm not going.

28:38.440 --> 28:38.970
You dare?

28:40.240 --> 28:42.970
When an elder summons, you can't refuse lightly.

28:43.160 --> 28:44.820
Let me tell you, Chu Youhuang.

28:44.830 --> 28:46.270
It doesn't matter if you don't respect me.

28:46.270 --> 28:48.030
But if you dare not respect my mother,

28:48.030 --> 28:48.550
guess if

28:49.030 --> 28:50.160
you'll live to see

28:50.160 --> 28:51.090
tomorrow's sun.

28:52.030 --> 28:53.440
My mother is the kind of person who dares

28:53.440 --> 28:55.570
to smash teacups in the imperial hall.

28:56.190 --> 28:58.790
You're using your mother to pressure me again.

28:59.750 --> 29:00.880
Go back, get changed,

29:00.880 --> 29:02.000
and wash up properly.

29:02.000 --> 29:02.690
Later,

29:02.720 --> 29:04.920
I'll have someone pick you up at the inn.

29:19.350 --> 29:20.070
My Lady.

29:20.280 --> 29:22.610
Chi Xue has something to discuss with you.

29:23.680 --> 29:24.160
Banxia.

29:25.030 --> 29:26.310
I'll accompany you to the Underground City.

29:26.310 --> 29:27.240
Xuanye can't go.

29:30.510 --> 29:31.860
Did something happen?

29:32.310 --> 29:33.750
His father said before that

29:33.750 --> 29:34.330
no matter what,

29:34.330 --> 29:36.460
he must not go to the Underground City.

29:37.270 --> 29:38.350
Why is that?

29:38.960 --> 29:39.480
Well...

29:40.960 --> 29:42.090
The Underground...

29:43.590 --> 29:44.720
I don't know either.

29:45.200 --> 29:46.560
Anyway, his father said that

29:46.560 --> 29:47.290
absolutely, absolutely,

29:47.290 --> 29:48.350
under no circumstances should he

29:48.350 --> 29:50.210
set foot in the Underground City.

29:54.430 --> 29:57.480
[Bamboo Sound]

29:56.350 --> 29:57.110
My Lady.

29:57.880 --> 29:59.080
What should we do now?

30:02.720 --> 30:04.030
What is that ridiculous rule

30:04.030 --> 30:05.630
Physician Jiu's father set?

30:06.960 --> 30:09.440
Why isn't he allowed to go to the Underground City?

30:09.440 --> 30:11.100
There might be other reasons.

30:12.200 --> 30:13.730
What reason could there be?

30:16.230 --> 30:16.790
Anyway,

30:16.960 --> 30:19.360
we need to prepare for both possibilities.

30:19.550 --> 30:21.000
This rule was set by Xuanye's father

30:21.000 --> 30:22.000
for Xuanye.

30:22.350 --> 30:23.880
He can't disobey it easily.

30:24.160 --> 30:24.750
And we certainly can't

30:24.750 --> 30:25.900
make him go against his father's orders

30:25.900 --> 30:27.160
due to our own affairs.

30:29.200 --> 30:30.180
But now that we've obtained

30:30.180 --> 30:31.140
new clues,

30:31.400 --> 30:31.960
I must go to Underground City

30:31.960 --> 30:33.550
no matter what.

30:35.240 --> 30:36.720
But I've heard

30:37.680 --> 30:39.480
there are not only demons there.

30:39.570 --> 30:40.070
There are also some

30:40.070 --> 30:41.480
shady businesses.

30:42.430 --> 30:45.160
It's hard to tell good from bad, a mix of all sorts.

30:47.440 --> 30:49.500
Chi Xue might not be able to handle it.

30:50.200 --> 30:52.260
We need to think of another solution.

30:52.640 --> 30:54.240
What is that other solution?

30:55.590 --> 30:57.050
A master, a Taoist priest,

30:57.680 --> 30:59.310
or someone like Xuanye,

30:59.330 --> 31:00.730
a skillful demon hunter.

31:00.750 --> 31:01.670
But that Master Kongtongzi

31:01.670 --> 31:03.350
from last time died.

31:04.030 --> 31:06.160
Where are we supposed to find a new one?

31:12.030 --> 31:14.430
If we can't find one, we'll go by ourselves.

31:14.720 --> 31:15.640
No matter what,

31:15.680 --> 31:16.880
as soon as the water recedes,

31:16.880 --> 31:18.310
we'll set off immediately.

31:18.310 --> 31:19.310
Nuts!

31:19.510 --> 31:21.830
Big, delicious, and crunchy nuts!

31:22.750 --> 31:23.510
Nuts!

31:23.920 --> 31:26.750
Big, delicious, and crunchy nuts!

31:27.160 --> 31:27.920
Nuts!

31:28.920 --> 31:29.310
Sir.

31:29.680 --> 31:30.830
Boss, can I try these?

31:30.830 --> 31:31.510
Of course you can.

31:31.510 --> 31:32.380
Please have a seat, sir.

31:32.380 --> 31:34.240
I'll bring them to you right away.

31:42.850 --> 31:45.980
Sir, have a taste first. You can buy some if you like them.

31:56.110 --> 31:57.350
Boss, I'll take both of these.

31:57.350 --> 31:58.010
No problem.

31:59.340 --> 32:00.970
Freshly picked apples!

32:01.590 --> 32:02.510
Apples!

32:05.790 --> 32:06.510
Master.

32:08.100 --> 32:09.500
Sir, your nuts are ready.

32:10.320 --> 32:10.920
Thank you.

32:11.030 --> 32:12.160
Have a nice day, sir.

32:12.790 --> 32:15.410
Nuts, delicious nuts!

33:26.430 --> 33:27.030
Chi Xue.

33:30.070 --> 33:31.000
What happened?

33:31.480 --> 33:32.810
Did you get into a fight?

33:33.480 --> 33:33.960
No.

33:34.030 --> 33:35.360
They attacked me first.

33:36.790 --> 33:37.640
Who are they?

33:38.440 --> 33:39.840
I don't know them either.

33:40.790 --> 33:43.190
Are they demon hunters or martial artists?

33:44.790 --> 33:45.720
I'm not sure.

33:46.880 --> 33:47.480
It's okay.

33:47.710 --> 33:48.350
Anyway, if we ever meet again,

33:48.350 --> 33:49.720
they won't be able to catch me.

33:49.720 --> 33:50.920
I'll go wash my hands.

33:55.180 --> 34:02.750
[Ganshan Clinic]

34:21.230 --> 34:22.230
Are you the owner?

34:24.210 --> 34:26.810
Are you here to see a doctor or pick up medicine?

34:27.030 --> 34:27.840
I'm not sick.

34:29.760 --> 34:31.690
So you're here to pick up medicine.

34:32.469 --> 34:33.929
I'm not here for medicine.

34:34.840 --> 34:36.170
I'm here to hunt demons.

34:38.580 --> 34:39.710
Please hold on, Sir!

34:54.480 --> 34:55.310
Have mercy!

35:06.670 --> 35:08.250
It seems we've been presumptuous.

35:08.250 --> 35:09.360
We thought this clinic

35:09.360 --> 35:10.700
had been occupied by demons.

35:10.700 --> 35:12.030
We didn't expect to meet

35:12.320 --> 35:13.760
a skilled disciple from the Eight Pillar Sect.

35:13.760 --> 35:15.240
I am Jiang Shangyun.

35:16.100 --> 35:17.900
This is my apprentice, Xue Qiao.

35:18.280 --> 35:19.680
He's also a demon hunter.

35:24.510 --> 35:25.510
We've long heard that the Eight Pillar Sect

35:25.510 --> 35:27.000
possesses the technique of demon control,

35:27.000 --> 35:28.150
and the disciples of your sect

35:28.150 --> 35:30.080
can subdue demons for your own use.

35:30.160 --> 35:33.360
Now that we've seen it ourselves today, it's truly extraordinary.

35:33.360 --> 35:33.960
Xuanye.

35:34.070 --> 35:35.600
They're the ones who hit me.

35:36.590 --> 35:37.280
Apologize.

35:39.070 --> 35:40.070
Of course we will.

35:40.800 --> 35:42.000
It was just a misunderstanding.

35:42.000 --> 35:43.690
Please don't blame us.

35:48.280 --> 35:50.410
Then we won't disturb you any further.

35:50.840 --> 35:52.240
We'll take our leave now.

35:55.710 --> 35:56.230
Xuanye.

35:58.320 --> 35:58.920
Master.

35:59.480 --> 36:01.610
Are we letting them off just like that?

36:04.290 --> 36:06.290
We'll talk about it when we get back.

36:16.590 --> 36:17.150
Soup.

36:17.840 --> 36:19.000
Be careful, it's hot.

36:19.000 --> 36:20.260
I'll go serve the soup.

36:22.610 --> 36:24.540
Who were those two people just now?

36:24.950 --> 36:26.550
They are both demon hunters.

36:26.800 --> 36:27.760
Demon hunters?

36:29.410 --> 36:30.890
They're not frauds

36:30.920 --> 36:32.850
like Master Kongtongzi, are they?

36:33.090 --> 36:34.090
I don't think so.

36:41.670 --> 36:42.800
Wait for me a moment.

36:56.480 --> 36:57.370
This is for you.

36:58.230 --> 36:59.230
What is this?

37:00.050 --> 37:02.310
The pass token for the Underground City.

37:09.760 --> 37:11.230
Are you going with me?

37:12.730 --> 37:14.460
Do you have anyone else in mind?

37:19.810 --> 37:21.630
Then in a few days, when the water recedes,

37:21.630 --> 37:22.710
we can set off.

37:24.880 --> 37:27.210
Is there anything else we need to prepare?

37:30.030 --> 37:31.030
Bring some money.

37:31.070 --> 37:32.400
Xuanye, have some soup.

37:35.360 --> 37:37.290
I'll go back to my room for a moment.

37:47.360 --> 37:49.260
Don't worry, I understand.

37:52.880 --> 37:53.590
Chi Xue.

37:55.070 --> 37:56.400
You told me before

37:56.890 --> 37:58.020
that he'd pay a price

37:58.050 --> 37:59.710
for using Hidden Dragon Case.

37:59.800 --> 38:02.760
Greedy Wolf is gluttonous, and Mountain Shaker is a sleep addict.

38:02.760 --> 38:04.410
That time at the Reunion Inn,

38:04.880 --> 38:06.140
he used the Fire Sword.

38:06.280 --> 38:08.320
What's the backlash of the Fire Sword?

38:08.320 --> 38:11.280
Using the Fire Sword damages one's life preservation.

38:11.280 --> 38:12.410
What does that mean?

38:12.670 --> 38:13.880
Life preservation means lifespan.

38:13.880 --> 38:14.430
Every time he uses it,

38:14.430 --> 38:15.920
his life gets shortened a bit.

38:15.920 --> 38:17.320
If he uses it frequently,

38:17.380 --> 38:19.110
his hair will turn grey faster.

38:37.190 --> 38:37.670
Come in.

38:44.300 --> 38:45.500
What brings you here?

38:47.230 --> 38:48.160
To dye your hair.

38:50.070 --> 38:51.920
It's okay. I'll just pluck them.

38:52.550 --> 38:55.010
There are too many. You can't pluck them all.

38:56.030 --> 38:57.630
Then I'll just leave them be.

38:58.320 --> 39:00.050
Didn't I tell you last time that

39:00.550 --> 39:03.080
having grey hair makes one look unenergetic?

39:07.750 --> 39:08.590
Are you busy?

39:11.280 --> 39:11.960
Not really.

39:13.030 --> 39:14.430
Then let me dye your hair.

39:48.790 --> 39:49.590
What's wrong?

39:53.890 --> 39:54.560
Did Chi Xue

39:54.590 --> 39:55.790
say something to you?

39:57.670 --> 39:58.110
No.

40:00.960 --> 40:02.000
About the Underground City,

40:02.000 --> 40:03.670
you don't need to worry too much.

40:03.670 --> 40:05.130
My father not letting me go

40:05.320 --> 40:06.320
was completely out of

40:06.320 --> 40:07.550
parental love.

40:07.960 --> 40:09.710
He was worried I might encounter danger.

40:09.710 --> 40:10.920
But every time I hunt demons,

40:10.920 --> 40:12.720
isn't my life always on the line?

40:13.000 --> 40:14.460
If I were afraid of danger,

40:15.040 --> 40:16.070
I might as well

40:16.090 --> 40:17.150
simply live my life as a physician

40:17.150 --> 40:18.480
and put down this sword.

40:34.590 --> 40:35.510
Maybe your father

40:35.510 --> 40:36.670
had other reasons.

40:38.670 --> 40:40.600
What other reasons could there be?

40:42.760 --> 40:44.360
Anyway, this is my business.

40:44.400 --> 40:46.200
You don't have to worry about it.

40:51.920 --> 40:53.380
These grey hairs of yours,

40:56.200 --> 40:57.590
did they grow because you used

40:57.590 --> 40:58.470
the Fire Sword?

41:06.510 --> 41:08.240
I don't think it's a good sword.

41:13.710 --> 41:15.030
It both harms your body

41:15.630 --> 41:16.960
and shortens your life.

41:19.270 --> 41:21.870
No matter how bad it is, it's better than death.

41:22.630 --> 41:24.820
If not for the Hidden Dragon Case that day,

41:24.820 --> 41:26.320
we might not have been able to escape

41:26.320 --> 41:28.030
from the Reunion Inn unscathed.

41:28.030 --> 41:30.030
Then you shouldn't have gone there.

41:30.080 --> 41:31.070
Knowing there's such

41:31.070 --> 41:32.230
an irreversible cost,

41:32.230 --> 41:32.710
why did you still choose to

41:32.710 --> 41:33.880
risk your life?

41:34.320 --> 41:36.120
What should you do if I didn't go?

41:36.400 --> 41:37.930
How should you save Yanqiu?

41:38.140 --> 41:38.650
And how could you

41:38.650 --> 41:39.520
get information about your father's whereabouts

41:39.520 --> 41:40.750
from the Cat Demon?

41:45.440 --> 41:46.570
That's my business.

41:47.830 --> 41:49.560
What does it have to do with you?

42:04.260 --> 42:05.320
Why are you crying?

42:05.700 --> 42:06.900
Who's crying?

42:07.180 --> 42:07.830
Sit still.

42:08.550 --> 42:09.750
I'm dyeing your hair.

42:16.830 --> 42:18.560
What exactly is wrong with you?

42:20.150 --> 42:21.670
I feel terrible.

42:23.900 --> 42:24.880
Ever since I came into your life,

42:24.880 --> 42:27.390
you've been constantly dragged into trouble.

42:27.390 --> 42:28.620
If it weren't for me,

42:28.840 --> 42:30.380
you wouldn't have been injured so badly.

42:30.380 --> 42:31.780
You wouldn't be so tired,

42:32.470 --> 42:33.600
and you wouldn't...

42:41.800 --> 42:43.060
It's all because of me.

42:44.150 --> 42:45.750
It has nothing to do with you.

42:46.480 --> 42:47.540
I'm a demon hunter.

42:48.110 --> 42:50.510
If it weren't you, it would be someone else.

42:50.870 --> 42:52.470
You don't understand.

42:59.350 --> 43:02.600
♫When you're in love, your smile is like the spring breeze♫

43:03.230 --> 43:06.390
♫Walking beside me, bathed in moonlight♫

43:06.320 --> 43:07.030
Don't move.

43:07.090 --> 43:10.600
♫No need for words, I already feel it♫

43:07.480 --> 43:09.280
There's something on your face.

43:10.620 --> 43:14.160
♫Dark hair like ink, time stretches on♫

43:14.690 --> 43:18.070
♫When you're in love, you wish this love could last forever♫

43:18.480 --> 43:21.410
♫Leaning in close to whisper softly♫

43:19.190 --> 43:20.510
Don't overthink it.

43:21.230 --> 43:22.590
This matter has nothing to do with you.

43:21.670 --> 43:24.000
♫I miss you♫

43:23.360 --> 43:24.840
People choose their own paths.

43:24.240 --> 43:26.110
♫On every moonlit night♫

43:25.570 --> 43:26.780
Don't blame yourself

43:26.210 --> 43:30.490
♫Tenderness ties us together♫

43:27.030 --> 43:28.150
for everything.

43:29.960 --> 43:31.150
At such a young age,

43:31.340 --> 43:32.130
you've traveled so far

43:31.740 --> 43:35.490
♫Let me take your hand and keep our promise♫

43:32.150 --> 43:33.760
to Guangping to look for your father.

43:33.760 --> 43:35.750
That's already quite an accomplishment.

43:35.750 --> 43:38.990
♫You shake my soul and pull at my heartstrings♫

43:36.140 --> 43:37.000
I'm helping you

43:37.630 --> 43:38.890
out of my own free will.

43:39.570 --> 43:41.440
♫If I think this world is beautiful♫

43:41.460 --> 43:43.190
♫It's partly because of the moon♫

43:43.330 --> 43:46.800
♫And mostly because I met you♫

43:47.280 --> 43:50.750
♫When life gets hard♫

43:51.240 --> 43:54.320
♫All I wish for is to stay by your side♫

43:52.760 --> 43:53.480
Oh no.

43:54.550 --> 43:55.360
It won't come off.

43:54.850 --> 43:56.710
♫This lingering love♫

43:56.730 --> 43:58.730
♫Is a treasure we both cherish♫

43:58.750 --> 44:01.440
♫When I turn around, you're there♫

44:01.530 --> 44:04.190
♫Right by my side♫

44:02.150 --> 44:03.550
What won't come off?
